</OL>
<div id="mntl-sc-block_68-0" class="comp mntl-sc-block allrecipes-sc-block-callout mntl-sc-block-universal-callout theme-recipetip js-block-callout--recipetip" data-tracking-id="mntl-sc-block-callout" data-tracking-container="true"> <h3 class="mntl-sc-block-universal-callout__heading">Recipe Tips</h3>
<div class="mntl-sc-block-universal-callout__body"><p>For a thicker mac and cheese, use more macaroni.</p><p>Grate cheese from a block for a smoother sauce; pre-shredded cheese may not melt as smoothly.</p><p>For extra-cheesy mac and cheese, add another 1/2 cup Cheddar cheese.</p><p>For fewer dishes, cook and drain the macaroni, then make the cheese sauce in the same pot. This method takes a little longer.</p></div>
