<span id="ugc-review__chip--text_13-0" class="comp ugc-review__chip--text mntl-text-block">Crowd-pleaser</span></span></div>
<div id="ugc-review__text_4-0" class="comp ugc-review__text mntl-text-block">Very good and easy to follow! And I already had all the ingredients I needed.I did add spices and ground beef to give it some more flavor.I added garlic powder, cayenne pepper, paprika &amp; onion powder to both the sauce and the ground beef as I cooked it. I measured with my heart so I'm not sure how much I used of each spice</div></div></div></div></div> </div>
</div>
