<div id="ugc-review__text_7-0" class="comp ugc-review__text mntl-text-block">I followed as directed, a little different from,the old recipe,I always use.I like it better. I make different versions of mac with spices,hots,this was perfect for a plain mac &amp; cheese,yup went at it before the pic, delicious</div></div></div></div></div> </div>
