<span id="ugc-review__chip--text_23-0" class="comp ugc-review__chip--text mntl-text-block">Might try again</span></span></div>
<div id="ugc-review__text_8-0" class="comp ugc-review__text mntl-text-block">Great recipe, Wrong cheese (on my part). I used Italian style blend cheese because it's what I had 2 cups of, and unfortunately, the recipe isn't so welcoming to different cheeses, it also was very thick, but that could've been part of my cheese switch up. But, I did find it to be easily Manipulable, easy to work with and edit. And as a 16 year old with little cooking experience, this was incredibly easy!</div></div></div></div></div> </div>
</div>
